{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
  <section class="dive-overview-panel dive-404-panel">
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined dive-404-icon" aria-hidden="true">scuba_diving</span>
    <h1>404 — Your Buddy Isn't Here</h1>
    <p class="dive-404-lede">
      You did a buddy check before this dive, right? Because whatever you were looking for has
      drifted off with the current, sunk into an unlogged wreck, or never existed at all.
    </p>
    <p>
      Dive computer readout: depth 404&nbsp;m, visibility zero, air supply questionable. Time to
      abort the dive and make a safe, controlled ascent.
    </p>
    <a href="/" class="button">Ascend to the Surface</a>
  </section>
{% endblock %}
